                    coach_r4_reconfig:      `<strong>Deliberate reconfiguration is the transforming capability in action.</strong> Renegotiating the partner, re-anchoring the acquired team, re-modularising capacity — you're reconfiguring the asset base in response to the aftermath rather than hoping it resolves itself.`,
