                    hint_routine:           `You handled the shock but built no standing routine. Institutionalise a sensing cadence, modular capacity and a reserve rule so the next discontinuity is cheaper.`,
                    hint_strong:            `Strong position — resilience and reserve are both healthy. Land it: reconfigure deliberately, build the standing routine, and pitch optionality over prediction.`,

